<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελλῐπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfailing, unceasing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. παρασχεῖν τὴν ἀγοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					799.17
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyzicus</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.33
			</span></i>; of rivers, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.103
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.495c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.439
			</span></i>, <u>CIG</u>(add.)<i><span class="en">
				2775b
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not lacking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					194
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>lacking nothing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				5.8.7
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερίττως, σημαίνειν</span>
			 mean <i>exactly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				43.3
			</span></i>.—Also spelt <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελλειπής</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Eutoc.
				<u>in Archim.</u>
				3.114.16
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in APr.</u>
				32.22
			</span></i>.</div>
